# The ffmpeg ForgeCAD records video with (research/render/record.md): public prebuilt release
# builds, each pinned by its exact, versioned (archived, not "latest") URL and the sha256 of that
# file as downloaded, and fetched by tools/fetch-ffmpeg.sh / .ps1 into the install's bin/. They are
# GPL builds; ForgeCAD runs ffmpeg as a separate program over a pipe and links none of it, and ships
# the build's licence and the link to its exact source version beside it (bin/ffmpeg-THIRD-PARTY.md).
# A platform with no pin gets none: the user's own (FORGE_FFMPEG, PATH), else PNG frames.
# Fields per platform: VERSION, URL, SHA256 (computed from the real download; never guessed), the
# archive's ffmpeg and ffprobe paths, its licence file, who built it.

